      "content": "idk i just feel like you're being a bit dismissive. if it was totally random wouldn't the spikes happen all the time? but the 78s spike was right after i had a really bad feeling about a certain part of my resume. it's like the system is reacting to my headspace. if you look at the sequence again, why would it stay so consistent at 45s and then suddenly jump like that only when my stress levels are high? maybe the pattern isn't in the numbers themselves, but in the relationship between the timing and the timing of my thoughts. does that make sense at all or am i crazy?",
